            <ul><li>Your products, uploaded with descriptions we write (up to 40)</li><li>Shopify checkout with your payments, shipping, tax basics, US and Mexico markets</li><li>Policy pages filled from your approved information</li><li>Instagram, Facebook and TikTok business profiles, Meta and TikTok pixels connected</li><li>Spanish versions of key pages</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="co-k">In this concept demo</p>
            <ul><li>Casa Ocre is a fictional brand</li><li>Product images are illustrations; real photography is not included in any package</li><li>The cart lives in this page and checkout charges nothing</li><li>Social profiles and the ad are mock-ups; nothing is posted or launched</li><li>Market prices use a fixed demo exchange rate</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
    {%- endcase -%}
  </article>
  {%- endfor -%}
</section>

<script type="module" src="{{ 'demos.js' | asset_url }}"></script>

